      "zh": "美债收益率狂飙：5年期19年来首破5%，10年期升至5.11%，美股全线下跌",
      "en": "Treasury yields surge: the 5-year tops 5% for the first time since 2007 and the 10-year hits 5.11% as stocks slide"
